09x the prior 10-day average of 562K. It never committed. The best close afterward was $76.96, within 5% of the level, and the chart ends at $75.43.","lesson":"This is an example of a breakout that never resolved. Price chopped around the level without committing either way. Sitting it out, or getting out flat, was a fine read."}}